"hint": "Turn the arm upright from the lower right shelf. Climb the left steps, expose yourself above the beam to draw the first charge, then drop. The brute now blocks the raised shard tunnel. Climb right to the upper pocket, drop through its left edge to bait a return charge, then jump back behind the upright arm. That charge breaks the small buffer. Drop down the right-hand chute, return under the beam and enter the cleared alcove. Keep moving to the shard and dash up into its escape line. Only then turn the arm right, cross ahead of the last charge and take the ordinary hop to the flag.",
